Dynamic subview sentinel diagnosis:
  The initial loop-first IR for ADI/Ludcmp contained literal index
  -9223372036854775808 after unrestricted greedy folding of dynamic subviews.
  Restricting post-loop rewriting to direct submap load/store/dim operations
  and omitting broad canonicalization removes every such index.

