Final result: all five previously raise-blocked kernels lower without residual
Polygeist operations and pass exact LARGE output comparison.

Correlation residual diagnosis and result:
  The affine `j = i + 1 .. M` wrapper around a nested dot-product was raised
  without applying its active predicate to the nested generic's yielded
  accumulator. This computed the diagonal/lower triangle as well as the upper
  triangle. Bound masking now covers nested-generic and direct-store yields.
  MINI FP64: pass.
  LARGE FP64: pass; build-and-compare wall_seconds=62.89; maxrss_kb=109992.
